<BaseLayout
  title="About Dr. Aayush Shrestha | Orthopaedic Surgeon Nepal"
  description="Learn about Dr. Aayush Shrestha’s education, orthopaedic and spine surgery focus, professional affiliations and approach to patient care in Nepal."
  canonical="https://draayushshrestha.com/about.html"
  active="about"
>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="shell page-hero"><p class="kicker">About the doctor</p><h1>Clinical judgement before intervention.</h1><p>Dr. Aayush Shrestha is an orthopaedic and spine surgeon practising in Kathmandu and Lalitpur, Nepal.</p></section>
    <section class="section section--tight"><div class="shell split"><div class="split__copy"><h2>Education and focused training</h2><p>Dr. Shrestha attended Bishop Cotton School in Shimla, India, completed his MBBS at the University of Dhaka and earned his master’s degree in Orthopaedic Surgery from Kathmandu University.</p><p>He completed a spine surgery fellowship at Grande International Hospital, affiliated with Spine Health International in Florida, and has also trained in endoscopic spine surgery. He has more than 15 years of experience in orthopaedic care and currently practises as an orthopaedic and spine surgeon at Grande International Hospital.</p></div><figure class="split__media split__media--portrait"><img src="assets/images/doctor-studio.jpg" width="667" height="1000" fetchpriority="high" alt="Portrait of Dr. Aayush Shrestha"></figure></div></section>
    <section class="section section--paper-2"><div class="shell split split--reverse"><div class="split__copy"><h2>Practice approach</h2><p>Orthopaedic and spine symptoms can have many causes. The consultation starts with history, examination and review of appropriate imaging. Treatment may include education, activity changes, medication, rehabilitation, injections or surgery.</p><ul class="fact-list"><li>Explain the likely diagnosis in understandable terms</li><li>Compare non-operative and operative choices</li><li>Set realistic expectations for recovery</li><li>Use surgery when clinical findings support it</li></ul></div><figure class="split__media"><img src="assets/images/surgery.jpg" width="1080" height="608" loading="lazy" alt="Dr. Aayush Shrestha working with a surgical team"></figure></div></section>
    <section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><h2>Professional affiliations</h2><p>The source website identifies current practice links with Grande International Hospital, Pacific Multispeciality Clinic and Shankhamul Healthcare.</p></div><div class="logo-wall"><ul><li><img src="assets/images/grande-hospital.png" width="500" height="500" alt="Grande International Hospital"></li><li><img src="assets/images/pacific-clinic.png" width="500" height="500" alt="Pacific Multispeciality Clinic"></li><li><img src="assets/images/shankhamul-healthcare.png" width="892" height="893" alt="Shankhamul Healthcare"></li></ul></div></div></section>
    <section class="section section--dark"><div class="shell cta-band"><h2>Professional education beyond the clinic.</h2><div><p>Dr. Shrestha’s published work includes public education on spine health, joint care and danger signs, plus television and conference appearances.</p><p class="action-block"><a class="btn btn--light" href="patient-guides.html">Explore patient guides</a></p></div></div></section>
    <section class="section section--paper-2 patient-experiences" id="reviews"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><h2>Patient experiences</h2><p>First-person accounts published on the existing website. Individual experiences vary and do not guarantee treatment outcomes.</p></div><div class="experience-layout"><article class="experience-feature"><blockquote>“Very respectful, professional, dedicated and a caring approach to his patient.”</blockquote><div class="experience-person"><img src="assets/images/patient-ojesh.png" width="90" height="90" alt="Ojesh Buddhacharya"><p><strong>Ojesh Buddhacharya</strong><span>Patient · Nepal</span></p></div></article><div class="experience-list"><article class="experience-row"><blockquote>“One of the best orthopaedic surgeons in Kathmandu.”</blockquote><div class="experience-person"><img src="assets/images/patient-sabin.png" width="90" height="90" alt="Sabin Maharjan"><p><strong>Sabin Maharjan</strong><span>Patient · Nepal</span></p></div></article><article class="experience-row"><blockquote>“One of the most well-spoken and comforting doctors.”</blockquote><div class="experience-person"><img src="assets/images/patient-arjesh.png" width="90" height="90" alt="Arjesh Karmacharya"><p><strong>Arjesh Karmacharya</strong><span>Patient · Nepal</span></p></div></article><article class="experience-row"><blockquote>“He showed utmost compassion and was available even at odd times.”</blockquote><div class="experience-person"><img src="assets/images/patient-prajali.png" width="90" height="90" alt="Prajali Singh"><p><strong>Prajali Singh</strong><span>Patient · Nepal</span></p></div></article></div></div></div></section>
